{%- assign sid = section.id -%}

{%- style -%}
#nx-safety-{{ sid }} {
  max-width: var(--container-width-narrow);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 8px 16px;
  font-family: var(--font-body-family, sans-serif);
  color: var(--color-text-main, #111827);
  line-height: 1.7;
  content-visibility: auto;
}
#nx-safety-{{ sid }} h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading-family, sans-serif);
  font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 30px);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.2;
  margin: 0 0 12px;
}
#nx-safety-{{ sid }} ul { padding-left: 18px; margin: 0; }
#nx-safety-{{ sid }} li {
  margin: 8px 0;
  color: var(--color-text-muted, #4b5563);
}
#nx-safety-{{ sid }} li strong { color: var(--color-text-main, #111827); }
{%- endstyle -%}

<section id="nx-safety-{{ sid }}" aria-label="Safety, legality and competitive sports">
  <h2>Safety, Legality &amp; Competitive Sports</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>This page is <strong>educational</strong>; it does not establish effectiveness, legality, suitability, or a safe protocol.</li>
    <li><strong>Regulations and product status vary</strong> by compound and jurisdiction. Verify current local and import rules.</li>
    <li><strong>Athletes:</strong> check the current governing-body and event rules; do not rely on a static retailer statement.</li>
    <li>Ask a qualified healthcare professional or pharmacist before use if you take medication, have a health condition, are pregnant or nursing, or are under 18.</li>
    <li>Follow the current label, avoid unsafe combinations, and do not drive or operate machinery if impaired.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

{% schema %}
{ "name": "NX — Safety & Legality", "settings": [], "presets": [{ "name": "NX — Safety & Legality" }] }
{% endschema %}
